"""Deli Counter 0.257.0 (the factory's roadmap 296): a building's package carries its drawings.

`build_package(..., spec_path=)` draws the building from its spec into the package's `drawings/` -- the exploded
axonometric and a plan a storey, each kept by Godot as the file it is, and `drawings.json` naming them; a facade gets
the reason it has none. An axonometric's canvas now holds its own title, lines and legend.

What this writes, every target pinned by its hash and refused on a mismatch, nothing written until every file has been
worked out: `portable_building.py`, `axonometric.py` and `test_axonometric.py` (anchored hunks); the new
`test_package_drawings.py`; VERSION; the CHANGELOG entry, prepended. Generated from a proven clone
(`patches/dc_drawings/gen_dc_drawings.py`), dry-run on a fresh clone to the clone's every byte, a second run refused
(`patches/dc_drawings/dry_run_*.out.txt`).

    python patches/patch_dc_drawings.py
    cd deli_counter && python -m pytest -q && python check.py
"""
